    "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Get ready for the challenge! Dive into the rhythm, break free from nobody, start from scratch without fearing hardships, and climb to the top step by step!<br><br>In this world everything is filled with rhythm. You, with your desire for success, must seize the opportunity, overcome various obstacles on the path of life, and achieve your dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose From Three Life Paths:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gangster: Begin as an insignificant henchman on the streets and rise to become a godfather who commands the ins and outs of the underworld!<br></li><li>Engineer: Start as a diligent worker on the assembly line and ascend to become a super engineer leading fleets into the vastness of space!<br></li><li>Chef: Kick off your journey as an apprentice, chopping wood and vegetables and grow into a world-renowned top food tycoon through hard work\uff01</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Diverse Careers: Players can experience various fun job tasks and their corresponding scene!<br></li><li>Difficulty Levels: Suitable for all skill levels, with rhythmic challenges that are easy to pick up but hard to master!<br></li><li>Stylish Presentation: Put on your VR and step into a cute rhythmic world!</li></ul><br>Follow the Rhythm, Move Your Hands!<br>Confront the Life With Courage!",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready for the challenge! Dive into the rhythm, break free from nobody, start from scratch without fearing hardships, and climb to the top step by step!<br><br>In this world everything is filled with rhythm. You, with your desire for success, must seize the opportunity, overcome various obstacles on the path of life, and achieve your dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose From Three Life Paths:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gangster: Begin as an insignificant henchman on the streets and rise to become a godfather who commands the ins and outs of the underworld!<br></li><li>Engineer: Start as a diligent worker on the assembly line and ascend to become a super engineer leading fleets into the vastness of space!<br></li><li>Chef: Kick off your journey as an apprentice, chopping wood and vegetables and grow into a world-renowned top food tycoon through hard work\uff01</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Diverse Careers: Players can experience various fun job tasks and their corresponding scene!<br></li><li>Difficulty Levels: Suitable for all skill levels, with rhythmic challenges that are easy to pick up but hard to master!<br></li><li>Stylish Presentation: Put on your VR and step into a cute rhythmic world!</li></ul><br>Follow the Rhythm, Move Your Hands!<br>Confront the Life With Courage!",
